<title>UK: Schweizerischer BV sets warrants on sterling/mark.</title>
<headline>Schweizerischer BV sets warrants on sterling/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutscland) has issued 50 million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the sterling/mark exchange rate, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   22.APR.97		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT, DUSSELDORF</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2.7000 DEM/1.0 STG</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE    MATURITY    STRIKE     ISSUE     PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> PUT     15.SEP.97   2.75 DEM   6.83 DEM  3.54 PCT  40.70 X</p>
<p> CALL    15.SEP.97   2.80 DEM   4.45 DEM  2.32 PCT  62.47 X</p>
<p> PUT     16.MAR.98   2.75 DEM   12.05 DEM 5.41 PCT  23.07 X</p>
<p> CALL    16.MAR.98   2.80 DEM   6.07 DEM  2.90 PCT  45.80 X</p>
<p> CALL    16.MAR.98   2.85 DEM   4.53 DEM  4.15 PCT  61.37 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
